=== the same assumptions under bounded search alone
--- informal-bmc, limit 2s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
a_gnt_after_busy             assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
a_false                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
c_gnt                        cover   undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
c_busy                       cover   undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
c_true                       cover   covered       informal-bmc depth 1
m_req                        assume  unprocessed
m_idle                       assume  unprocessed
verdict: a false assertion proven under each of three assumption sets, and nothing in a report says so
